B.a_S=new A.h3("culture.hnatlang","Hnatl\xe2ng","Community work","Khawtl\xe2ng t\xe2na mipuite hna thawh ho","Hnatl\xe2ngah chuan khawtl\xe2ng mamawh, ent\xeer n\xe2n kawng tihfai emaw hmun siam\u1e6dhat emaw, mipuite an thawh ho \u1e6dh\xeen.","People work together on a practical need shared by the community, such as cleaning or repairing a common place.","Z\xeengah khawtl\xe2ng kawng tihfai hnatl\xe2ng kan nei ang.","\ud83e\uddf9",0)
